cff-version: 1.2.0
title: EEG Connectivity Pipeline
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. This repository is a
  portfolio artifact derived from research work; it is not the analysis code of
  any published study, and running it does not reproduce any published result.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Joghatayi
    given-names: Muhammed
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB pipeline for EEG: trigger-level event reconstruction,
  EEGLAB preprocessing (clean_rawdata, Picard, ICLabel) with criterion-based
  subject QC, FieldTrip sensor connectivity (debiased squared weighted phase-lag index
  as primary measure, with phase-locking value and coherence), Brain
  Connectivity Toolbox graph analysis, and paired sign-flip inference with FDR
  and the Network-Based Statistic. Optional extensions cover vigilance
  confounds, exploratory template-based source connectivity, and power-envelope
  correlation and mutual information.
keywords:
  - EEG
  - functional connectivity
  - phase-lag index
  - graph theory
  - network-based statistic
  - EEGLAB
  - FieldTrip
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
